I'll order one for sure when it will be availble.

You may not remember but back in 2009 I typeset and printed my own copy of
CLL (I also made a donation of 50$ to LLG as if I had bought the book):

https://goo.gl/photos/KQcbVaV18SWFK2EJ7
https://goo.gl/photos/2i2iy3hECpciJVx27
https://goo.gl/photos/gB3MyDoM5ig3e2EW9

I'll be happy to have the new official version.

(To tell the truth the copy I printed for myself has chapter 20 mising :( I
made an error in assembling the PDF before sending it to Lulu. It will be
good to have the full book, after all this time :) )




